  "description": {
   "en": "On his way to school, high school boy Koma Taisuke is approached by a stranger who says to him, \"We finally meet again.\" Koma is surprised, but later that day during class he is introduced to a new transfer student, Chiaki Kei - The same stranger who approached him on the street. What's more, Chiaki claims to be Koma's childhood friend--!?"
